  2376	    only removes the eight-step ceremony the builder used to orchestrate by hand.
  2377	
  2378	    Fail-closed at every step: the first thing that cannot be verified stops the
  2379	    run and is named. WHO reviews and WHAT COMMAND runs them comes from the
  2380	    operator's trusted policy OUTSIDE the repository (see reviewer_policy) — a
