   961	    reviewer transcript, committed alongside the report and hashed so tampering
   962	    with the log invalidates the recorded digest. It does NOT auto-derive the
   963	    verdict — reviewer output is prose, and inferring pass/fail from it
   964	    reliably is not possible — so the caller still states pass/fail, but now
   965	    against a captured, inspectable artifact rather than thin air.
