  1518	    zero open findings. A verdict claiming `captured`/`attached` whose
  1519	    transcript is missing/tampered/replayed is rejected outright (the label
  1520	    must never be a lie); with require_captured, a self-attested verdict also
  1521	    fails — captured OR attached both satisfy it (each carries a committed,
  1522	    hash-bound transcript; the honest difference is documented in GATE.md)."""
