  1598	        # the same failure this tool warns about for over-classification, one
  1599	        # notch up. `--human-gate-scope irreversible` narrows the STOP (not the
  1600	        # review: tests, diff gate and red-team still run on every L3) to the
  1601	        # changes you cannot take back — schema migrations, money paths, and
  1602	        # authz/RLS policy. On that same repo it took the human stops from 47%
  1603	        # to 25% of commits.
